    Assertion:a-cursor-is-a,sentence:a cursor is a stack of matches — resolving one re-finds every level from the magazine down and lands on the exact record it names
    Assertion:a-cursor-can-name,sentence:a cursor can name a level not just a leaf — a two-deep cursor lands on the cloud and stops there
