    Assertion:a-magazine-can-be,sentence:a magazine can be flat — a one-level cursor lands on the card sitting directly under the mag with no cloud between
    Assertion:a-cursor-is-unconfusible,sentence:a cursor is unconfusible in a crowd — among forty near-identical cards it lands on exactly the one it names
